  "1.2.15": "[A] French translation added (PR#56, dracnis).",
  "1.2.14": "[M] Added Comparator Switch sample rate config setting.\n[F] Alarm Siren sound emission fixed.",
  "1.2.13": "[R] Release build.",
  "1.2.13-b2": "[F] Fixed Link Receiver signal modes (issue #48, ty graywaren).\n[F] Updated Forge/gradle.",
  "1.2.13-b1": "[U] Initial 1.18.1 port.",
  "1.2.12": "[U] Mappings ported, updated to Forge 1.16.5-36.2.0.",
  "1.2.11": "[F] Lang file fixes.",
  "1.2.10": "[A] Dimmer Switch can be used as analog Switch Link source.\n[A] Industrial Analog Switch Link Receiver added.\n[A] Industrial Analog Switch Link Transmitter added.\n[F] Comparator Switch link triggering bug fixed.",
  "1.2.9": "[F] Lang file update zh_cn (PR#41, ty kappa-maintainer).\n[F] Fixed Power Plant documentation (issue#42, ty Artin).",
  "1.2.9-b1": "[F] Fixed Stained Redstone Sensitive Glass recipe (issue #40).",
  "1.2.8": "[R] Release build.\n[U] MC1.16.5 enabled.\n[M] Block materials unified.",
  "1.2.7": "[R] Release build v1.2.7.\n[F] Opt-out config pack level based.",
  "1.2.7-b2": "[F] Config load/apply condition fixed.",
  "1.2.7-b1": "[A] Analog Switch Linking signals added.\n[A] Gauges and Indicators can be wirelessly connected to switches.\n[A] Comparator Switch and Link Sender support analog data transmissions.\n[A] Elevator Button up/down arrows added depending on where the wall is clicked when placing.",
  "1.2.6": "[R] Release build  1.2.6.",
  "1.2.6-b2": "[A] Gauges can be explicitly set to Comparator-Input mode (click with a Redstone Torch).\n[A] Auto switch buttons only display the current configurations on first click.",
  "1.2.6-b1": "[U] Ported to 1.16.4.",
  "1.2.5": "[R] Release build 1.2.5.",
  "1.2.5-b1": "[A] Linked switches are marked with particles when holding the Switch Link Pearl.\n[U] Partial internal code refurbishments.",
  "1.2.4": "[U] Updated to Forge 1.16.3-34.1.0.\n[A] Indicators and Gauges are invertible (input from Vallen while Forgecraft'ing).\n[F] Ambient occlusion and GUI lightning fixes.",
  "1.2.4-b8": "[U] Ported to MC1.16.3.",
  "1.2.4-b7": "[U] Updated Forge to 33.0.37 (breaking change).",
  "1.2.4-b6": "[U] Updated Forge, adapted new mappings to 20200723-1.16.1.\n[F] Fixed Contact Switch detection range.",
  "1.2.4-b5": "[F] Mapping adaption to Forge 1.16.2-33.0.20.",
  "1.2.4-b4": "[U] Ported to 1.16.2.",
